“Covered Procurement” means procurement for governmental purposes for which the value equals or exceeds the relevant thresholds set out in the in the Canadian Free Trade Agreement or the Canada-European Union Comprehensive Economic and Trade Agreement or any other trade treaty the City may be subject to;
3.1.21
“Department” means a collection of Divisions under the control of a Commissioner of the City;
3.1.22
“Director” means a Deputy Commissioner, Senior Director, Executive Director, Director, the City Solicitor, the City Clerk or a Deputy Fire Chief of the City, or his or her designate, who is responsible for a specific Division;
